{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人鄧凱文（Eunice）身材火辣深受觀眾追捧。</p><p>近日，她到了往美國旅行並不忘在社交平台派福利，分享了多張在當地拍下的性感美照，瞬間掀起熱烈討論。</p><p>鄧佩文身穿白色絲質低胸吊帶連衣裙，貼身的設計將她玲瓏浮凸有的S形曲線完美呈現。</p><p>在陽光與晚霞的折射</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.336510+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:01:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.543348+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.543348+00:00","content_hash":"a7f96e2eaa79a8c855e1d3dbb752bbd41b92c5ca190bb80ae26b2009b3258113","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}